<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-row approach-v3"><div class="contact-info-left"><div class="contact-v2-info"><div class="section-header _w-w-work v2"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">START A CONVERSATION</div></div><h2 class="section-heading">Tell us what you’re working on.</h2><p class="font-regular contact-head contact-v2">Give us a look at the challenge you’re facing, and let’s explore what the right solution could look like.</p></div><div class="contact-v2-list"><div data-to-top="0" class="contact-v2-item"><div class="about-icon-wrap case-v2 contact-v2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="100%" class="about-card-icon v2"><path d="M7 7.5L9.94202 9.23943C11.6572 10.2535 12.3428 10.2535 14.058 9.23943L17 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M21.996 10C21.9933 9.63328 21.9894 9.77017 21.9842 9.5265C21.9189 6.46005 21.8862 4.92682 20.7551 3.79105C19.6239 2.65528 18.0497 2.61571 14.9012 2.53658C12.9607 2.48781 11.0393 2.48781 9.09882 2.53657C5.95033 2.6157 4.37608 2.65526 3.24495 3.79103C2.11382 4.92681 2.08114 6.46003 2.01576 9.52648C1.99474 10.5125 1.99475 11.4926 2.01577 12.4786C2.08114 15.5451 2.11383 17.0783 3.24496 18.2141C4.37608 19.3498 5.95033 19.3894 9.09883 19.4685C9.7068 19.4838 10.4957 19.4943 11 19.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15.5861 18.6482C14.9573 19.0167 13.3087 19.7693 14.3128 20.711C14.8033 21.171 15.3496 21.5 16.0365 21.5H19.9557C20.6425 21.5 21.1888 21.171 21.6793 20.711C22.6835 19.7693 21.0348 19.0167 20.406 18.6482C18.9315 17.7839 17.0606 17.7839 15.5861 18.6482Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path><path d="M19.9961 14C19.9961 15.1046 19.1006 16 17.9961 16C16.8915 16 15.9961 15.1046 15.9961 14