 13.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M21 10.5V6.5C21 4.84315 19.6569 3.5 18 3.5C16.3431 3.5 15 4.84315 15 6.5V10.5C15 12.1569 16.3431 13.5 18 13.5C19.6569 13.5 21 12.1569 21 10.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M20.0901 19H19.0751M19.0751 19H14M19.0751 19V18.2748C19.0751 17.8049 19.0751 17.57 19.2317 17.5115C19.3884 17.4531 19.5727 17.6192 19.9414 17.9514L20.7462 18.6766C20.9154 18.8291 21 18.9053 21 19C21 19.0947 20.9154 19.1709 20.7462 19.3234L19.9414 20.0486C19.5727 20.3808 19.3884 20.5469 19.2317 20.4885C19.0751 20.43 19.0751 20.1951 19.0751 19.7252V19Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap contact"><h3 class="font-extra-normal case-work contact-v2-step">We Move Forward</h3><p class="font-small help">If there’s a fit, we define the right way to work together.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="about-image-wrap contact-v2-step"><img class="about-image v2" src="/images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8).webp" alt="Close-up of a dark precision device with a round control button on a black rail" sizes="100vw" data-parallax="true" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8)-p-500.webp 500w, /images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8)-p-800.webp 800w, /images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8)-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8)-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8)-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/6ac74c66e803144a8d66fb2f_Frame%202147227629%20(8).webp 2560w"/></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap contact-faq"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="section-header left"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</div></div><div class="max-width-42 faq-v3"><h2 class="section-heading small">A few answers to help you understand how we work, where we can help, and what to expect from an ANANTACAST engagement.</h2></div></div><div class="faq-wrapper"><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">01.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What does ANANTACAST actually do?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">ANANTACAST helps technology-driven companies solve complex challenges across strategy, engineering, AI, and intelligent systems—from defining the right direction to building scalable solutions.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">02.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What types of companies do you work with?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Most of our clients are product teams in robotics, medical technology, energy, and industrial automation, along with software companies whose platforms depend on connected devices and data.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">03.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Can ANANTACAST help us if we only have an idea?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Yes. A rough idea is a fine starting point—we run a short discovery to test demand and feasibility, sketch the first architecture, and estimate what a credible proof of concept would cost.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">04.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Do you provide strategy or actual engineering support?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Both, depending on where you are. Some clients need a clear technical direction first; others need experienced engineers to design, code, and validate systems that already have a defined scope.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">05.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">How do you approach a complex technical problem?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">We clarify the goal, gather evidence on how the current system behaves, model the options, and prototype the weakest link first, so every decision rests on measured results rather than opinion.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">06.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3 last"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What makes ANANTACAST different from a traditional consultancy?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Instead of rotating junior staff and long reports, you get a small senior team that designs, builds, and measures the solution with you—and stays responsible until it performs in the real world.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
